━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ CenterlineEdge

+ chain [Index]
+ start Index?
+ finish Index?
+ points [Point]
+ start-link CenterlineLink?
+ finish-link CenterlineLink?
+ is-dot = false
+ is-used = false

────────────────────
+ This
    - chain
    - start
    - finish

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
